From d1968f877c4fa99c5ab5c970bbe423552d86a141 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 12:45:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD Vim visual selection and yanking for both terminal
 panes

Terminal users need native modal copy behavior while inspecting agent lists and chat transcripts. The UI tracks visual selections in the active pane, routes movement keys to that selection state, and emits clipboard output when the selection is yanked.
---
 Spec.md              |   2 +
 docs/architecture.md |  10 +-
 src/terminal_app.rs  |  50 +++-
 src/ui.rs            | 699 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 src/ui_harness.rs    |  23 +-
 tests/ui_harness.rs  |  58 ++++
 6 files changed, 778 insertions(+), 64 deletions(-)

